    "frames_with_duplicate_coordinates": "Number of native frames in which at least two different ROI rows have exactly the same coordinate triple. Denominator is native frames.",
    "excess_duplicate_detections": "Sum of the excess rows beyond one per distinct coordinate triple within each frame, divided for the fraction by total rows across native frames.",
    "numerics": "Read the original NPZ points as stored, check finite values, treat positive and negative zero equally, and use exact equality without rounding, axis transformations, distance tolerance, or tracker results."
